  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Zest lime to get a generous pinch and cut into wedges.\n• Pick and roughly chop mint.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66fffd6a99e8e2a18bd753e7-4f6c17e6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66fffd6a99e8e2a18bd753e7-5aa72f70.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine sweet chilli sauce, lime zest and mayonnaise in a small bowl. Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix, carrot, mint, a squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66fffd6a99e8e2a18bd753e7-cd9b60f0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread some sweet chilli mayo over tortillas. Top with some mint slaw and satay tofu. Drizzle over sesame dressing.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66fffd6a99e8e2a18bd753e7-b9172620.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
